---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="flex flex-col gap-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold">About</h1>
    <p class="text-(--color-muted)">
      I&rsquo;m Alex, a software engineer focused on .NET, Azure, and applied AI. I build
      production systems end to end — APIs, cloud infrastructure, and lately the model-facing
      layer on top of them — and I like when the tools I use to build something double as proof
      that I know how they work.
    </p>
    <p class="text-(--color-muted)">
      This site is one example: an Astro frontend on Azure Static Web Apps, a C# Azure Functions
      API, and a voice bot backed by Azure AI Foundry that you can talk to about my experience.
    </p>
    <div class="flex gap-4 pt-4 text-sm">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/aaksionau"
        class="rounded-md border border-(--color-border) px-4 py-2 hover:border-(--color-accent)"
      >
        GitHub
      </a>
      <a
        href="#"
        data-todo="replace with real LinkedIn profile URL"
        class="rounded-md border border-(--color-border) px-4 py-2 hover:border-(--color-accent)"
      >
        LinkedIn
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
